# language: en
@process_PROC-001 @requirement_REQ-001 @rule_BR-001
Feature: Evaluate transfer eligibility

  @scenario_SCN-001
  Scenario: Active account with sufficient balance
    Given the source account is active
    And has sufficient balance
    When eligibility is evaluated
    Then the result is "ELEGIVEL"

  @scenario_SCN-002
  Scenario: Inactive account
    Given the source account is inactive
    And has sufficient balance
    When eligibility is evaluated
    Then the result is "CONTA_INATIVA"

  @scenario_SCN-003
  Scenario: Insufficient balance
    Given the source account is active
    And has insufficient balance
    When eligibility is evaluated
    Then the result is "SALDO_INSUFICIENTE"
